 Atlantic Zone Environmental Probe - Alpine Linux diskless (100% RAM)

   Host      rpi-probe            SSH      port 34522, key only
   Storage   tmpfs, volatile      Metrics  node-exporter on :9100
   Sensors   DS18B20 on 1-Wire    Config   probe.conf on the SD card

 Everything under / lives in RAM and resets on reboot. Persistent changes
 belong on the SD card boot partition, mounted at /media/mmcblk0p1.

 Useful commands
   probe-inventory        hardware, network, sensors and service summary
   rc-status              service states
   cat /sys/bus/w1/devices/*/w1_slave    raw sensor readings

 Support: Atlantic Zone - https://github.com/atlantic-zone

